      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KIANDO ESTATE (8) drawn the outside box and could get a clear run. Was below best last time when 6th and beaten 16 lengths at this track (19.18). Form here at this distance is strong including three wins. Has ability and is a key runner. CANYA PLEASE (1) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at this track following on from a second place finish (18.66) there the start prior. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Should be in this for a long way. EARLY CONCRETE (2) comes off an average run last start when eighth at Gunnedah over 431m behind Unhurried (25.83) in a Grade 5. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Expected to run well. KERT KERT (4) cannot be overlooked following a recent top-three finish in impressive time.",
